B.a6D=new A.K(B.mr,["Mohammed Alsayed Ahmed","Flutter Developer","Computer Science Student",B.wx,B.u,"I am a third year computer science student who is passionate about designing and building \nsoftware as well as academic research in computer science fields. With 3+ years of experience \nworking with the Flutter framework, and focusing on mobile apps, I have built numerous projects \nfrom simple user interfaces to real-world apps with complex state management architectures. \nI am driven by building meaningful products and contributing to innovative, challenging projects.",B.XO,"Present",B.XM,B.XE,"Portfolio","Home","About","About Me","Experience","Projects","Resume","Download resume","Could not open the url","Language unknown"],t.yf)
